BaseVault_executeCcipSend
├── when bridgeAmount is zero
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAmount
├── when destinationChainSelector is zero or equals the current chain selector
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__InvalidDestinationChainSelector
└── when destinationChainSelector is not a registered crosschain vault
    └── it should revert with BaseVault__DestinationVaultNotSet
